      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You let people through for money, don't you?",
      "JA_current": "金をもらって人を通してるんだろ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1957,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So, I make a little money on the side for letting some shit leak in and out of the Zone, so what? I live and let others live too, right?",
      "JA_current": "ゾーンからガラクタをちょろまかすのを見逃して、小遣いを稼いでる。それがどうした？ 俺だって生きていかなきゃならんし、連中にもそうさせてやってるだけだ。文句あるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1960,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Clear enough.",
      "JA_current": "なるほどな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1963,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hey, wise guy, do you happen to know how much my official salary is?",
      "JA_current": "おい、知った風な口を利く前に、俺たちの正規の給料がいくらか知ってるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1966,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Not much, I guess.",
      "JA_current": "大した額じゃないんだろうな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1969,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Damn right! You come and try to make it on that small change for yourself. I bet you wouldn't last a year.",
      "JA_current": "その通りだよ！ てめえもその小銭だけで暮らしてみろ。1年も持ちやしねえよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1972,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It's really hard to make it, indeed.",
      "JA_current": "確かに、やっていくのは大変だろうな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1975,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Just imagine it. For that pittance of a salary, I am expected to display enormous pride in my service, my State and my government! What a fucking joke...",
      "JA_current": "想像してみろ。そんなすずめの涙ほどの給料で、軍務だの国家だの政府だのに誇りを持てって言われるんだぞ！ 笑わせるな、冗談じゃねえ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "7",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1978,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So you've lost all pride in your service?",
      "JA_current": "軍人としての誇りはもうないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "8",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1981,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "The big wigs, every single one, are up to their necks in wealth thanks to the shit they smuggle from the Zone! All this while we're stuck here, getting shot up, torn up by anomalies, irradiated to shit and eaten alive by freaks crawling out of every shrub and not seeing a single dime of those profits that the higher-ups are swimming in. You tell me, what is there to be proud of!? Why should I keep away from this kind'a business?!",
      "JA_current": "上層部のお偉方はどいつもこいつも、ゾーンからの密輸品で私腹を肥やして贅沢三昧だ！ 一方で俺たちはここに置き去りにされ、銃撃され、アノマリーに引き裂かれ、放射能を浴び、藪から飛び出してくる化け物に生きたまま食われそうになってる。それなのに、上の連中ががっぽり稼いだ利益なんざ一銭も回ってきやしねえ。なあ、これのどこに誇りを持てって言うんだ！？ なんで俺がこんな割りのいい商売から手を引かなきゃならねえんだよ！？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "9",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1984,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Good question.",
      "JA_current": "もっともな言い分だな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "10",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1987,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What is every soldier's primary objective in the Zone? To carry out orders and survive! It just so happens I am carrying out my orders, and I am surviving by any means necessary!",
      "JA_current": "ゾーンにいる兵士の最優先任務は何だ？ 命令を遂行して生き延びることだ！ 俺は命令に従ってるし、生き延びるためならどんな手だって使う、それだけの話だ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1990,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "This is just your way to make it through.",
      "JA_current": "それがお前の生き残り方ってわけか。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "12",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_phr_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1993,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_phr_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Holy crap! Everywhere I look I'm surrounded by fuckin' morons, all over the place! If I have to put up with this a little while longer, I'll either fuckin' waste everybody around me, or put a bullet through my own head!..",
      "JA_current": "まったくクソったれだ！ どこを見ても救いようのない馬鹿ばかり並びやがって！ これ以上こんな連中に付き合わされたら、周りの奴らを皆殺しにするか、自分の頭を撃ち抜いちまうぞ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "13",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:ogse_kuznetsov_rep_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1996,
      "string_id": "ogse_kuznetsov_rep_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, you're absolutely right! Plenty of morons around! See you!",
      "JA_current": "ああ、あんたの言う通りだ！ 周りは馬鹿ばかりだな。じゃあな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "kuznetsov_about_job",
          "phrase_id": "14",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
